- No.

786
00:53:33.962 --> 00:53:35.712
Shut up!

787
00:53:37.090 --> 00:53:39.430
You're gonna take that money.

788
00:53:40.135 --> 00:53:43.755
And you and I are heading to Arizona...

789
00:53:44.139 --> 00:53:46.059
...because there is a guy there...

790
00:53:46.224 --> 00:53:49.024
...that's gonna give us another $15.000...

791
00:53:49.185 --> 00:53:54.065
...for a nice. new baby.

792
00:53:59.321 --> 00:54:01.071
If you don't...

793
00:54:01.907 --> 00:54:03.617
...I'm gonna come back here later...

794
00:54:04.492 --> 00:54:08.462
...and I'm gonna tell Laura and John...

795
00:54:08.622 --> 00:54:10.832
...you wanted to take
their last baby from them.

796
00:54:10.999 --> 00:54:12.459
No.

797
00:54:12.626 --> 00:54:14.036
They'll hate you.

798
00:54:20.592 --> 00:54:22.552
Clean this up.

799
00:54:26.097 --> 00:54:28.217
[DOOR OPENS THEN CLOSES]

800
00:54:28.391 --> 00:54:30.391
