804
00:55:01.967 --> 00:55:03.717
♪ My feet can't fail me now ♪

805
00:55:03.885 --> 00:55:07.135
♪ My feet can't fail me now
My feet can't fail me now ♪♪

806
00:55:07.597 --> 00:55:09.977
