807
00:55:19.609 --> 00:55:20.819
[DOG GROWLING]

808
00:55:20.986 --> 00:55:21.986
Hey! Hey!

809
00:55:22.529 --> 00:55:25.239
Get... Get back here!

810
00:55:25.782 --> 00:55:27.742
[DOG BARKING]

811
00:55:34.124 --> 00:55:37.004
