813
00:55:39.462 --> 00:55:42.302
ANNA [ON MESSAGE]: Leave a message
and I'll call you right back.

814
00:55:42.465 --> 00:55:44.175
God.

815
00:55:44.342 --> 00:55:47.052
It's so goddamn typical of you.

816
00:55:47.220 --> 00:55:49.560
Some asshole buys you some fancy shit...

817
00:55:49.723 --> 00:55:52.183
...and you fall head over heels for him.

818
00:55:52.350 --> 00:55:54.230
Call me.

819
00:55:55.937 --> 00:55:58.727
Stupid bitch. Mm.

820
00:55:58.898 --> 00:56:00.898
